{'symbol': 'COF', 'date': '2023-06-30 16:40:00', 'title': 'CAPITAL ONE ANNOUNCES STRESS CAPITAL BUFFER REQUIREMENT', 'text': 'MCLEAN, VA. , JUNE 30, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NYSE: COF) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS PRELIMINARY\xa0STRESS CAPITAL BUFFER REQUIREMENT ("SCB"), AS CALCULATED BASED ON THE FEDERAL RESERVE\'S\xa02023\xa0COMPREHENSIVE CAPITAL ANALYSIS AND REVIEW PROCESS ("CCAR"), IS 4.8\xa0PERCENT, EFFECTIVE OCTOBER 1, 2023.'}